{"id":"n38764-1-7","stage":4,"title":"기교 · 技巧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38764-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 열린 독주회의 연주가 아주 좋았어요.","zh":"今天举办的独奏会演奏得非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"열린","meaning":"召开，举行","explanation":"열리다：召开，举行；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74352","senseId":"2","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열린","audio":"/audio/0399d6e47b105ffe5fa6.mp3"}},{"text":"독주회의","meaning":"独奏会","explanation":"독주회：独奏会；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"독주회","audio":"/audio/297ce890aef29ad24efa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48538","senseId":"1","lemma":"독주회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"독주회의","audio":"/audio/2c703a9f162954a33624.mp3"}},{"text":"연주가","meaning":"演奏","explanation":"연주：演奏；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연주","audio":"/audio/9c951c9c34a78317b25a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14024","senseId":"1","lemma":"연주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연주가","audio":"/audio/af5f3b14a4f27eea6333.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았어요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033"